Package: gnome-shell-extension-bogenzeit
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: David M. Anderson <david.anderson@excelano.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 48~), bz (>= 0.7.0)
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/excelano/bogenzeit-gnome
Description: Bogenzeit beside the clock in the GNOME top bar
 Shows the time as Bogenzeit, a position on the Sun's arc counted in spans
 from solar noon by day and solar midnight by night, next to the clock in
 the GNOME Shell top bar. A click on the reading switches it between spans
 and kiloseconds. The reading comes from the bz command at the default
 place that bz place sets.
